Package: AnthropoAgeR
Title: Calculate Second Generation Biological Aging Measures Using AnthropoAge and PhenoAge
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Description: Provides tools to estimate second-generation biological age biomarkers derived from anthropometric and clinical data, including AnthropoAge, S-AnthropoAge, and PhenoAge. The package also computes sex-stratified age acceleration measures (AnthropoAgeAccel and PhenoAgeAccel) based on published models and supports both individual-level and cohort-level calculations.
